function pdfSafe(value){return String(value??'').normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'').replace(/[^ -~]/g,' ').replace(/\\/g,'\\\\').replace(/\(/g,'\\(').replace(/\)/g,'\\)')}
function downloadReportPdf(){let unpaid=data.purchases.filter(p=>p.invoicePaid!=='Oui'),budget=unpaid.reduce((sum,p)=>sum+(p.components||[]).reduce((s,c)=>s+Number(c.qty||0)*Number(c.price||0),0),0),lines=['EXPEDIT TOOLMANAGER - RAPPORT','Date : '+new Date().toLocaleDateString('fr-FR'),'','SYNTHESE','Projets de moules : '+data.projects.length,'Projets en cours : '+data.projects.filter(p=>p.status!=='Validé').length,'Projets termines : '+data.projects.filter(p=>p.status==='Validé').length,'Moules en panne : '+data.moulds.filter(m=>m.status==='Panne').length,'Reparations en cours : '+data.repairs.filter(r=>r.status!=='Terminé').length,'Reparations terminees : '+data.repairs.filter(r=>r.status==='Terminé').length,'Factures non payees : '+unpaid.length,'Montant non paye : '+money(budget),'','PROJETS DE FABRICATION'];data.projects.forEach(p=>{let log=latestProjectLog(p);lines.push(`${p.id} | ${p.name}`,`Statut: ${p.status} | Avancement: ${p.progress}% | Urgence: ${p.priority}`,`Dernier blocage: ${log?.blocker||'Aucun blocage'}${log?.blockerStatus?' ('+log.blockerStatus+')':''}`,`Mise a jour: ${log?.date||'Aucune'}`,'')});let pages=[];for(let i=0;i<lines.length;i+=42)pages.push(lines.slice(i,i+42));let objects=[''],pageIds=[],contentIds=[],fontId=3+pages.length*2;pages.forEach((page,i)=>{let pageId=3+i*2,contentId=pageId+1;pageIds.push(pageId);contentIds.push(contentId);objects[pageId]=`<< /Type /Page /Parent 2 0 R /MediaBox [0 0 595 842] /Resources << /Font << /F1 ${fontId} 0 R >> >> /Contents ${contentId} 0 R >>`;let commands='BT /F1 10 Tf 45 795 Td 14 TL '+page.map((line,j)=>`${j?'T* ':''}(${pdfSafe(line)}) Tj`).join(' ')+' ET';objects[contentId]=`<< /Length ${commands.length} >>\nstream\n${commands}\nendstream`});objects[1]='<< /Type /Catalog /Pages 2 0 R >>';objects[2]=`<< /Type /Pages /Kids [${pageIds.map(id=>id+' 0 R').join(' ')}] /Count ${pages.length} >>`;objects[fontId]='<< /Type /Font /Subtype /Type1 /BaseFont /Helvetica >>';let pdf='%PDF-1.4\n',offsets=[0];for(let i=1;i<objects.length;i++){if(!objects[i])continue;offsets[i]=pdf.length;pdf+=`${i} 0 obj\n${objects[i]}\nendobj\n`}let xref=pdf.length;pdf+=`xref\n0 ${objects.length}\n0000000000 65535 f \n`;for(let i=1;i<objects.length;i++)pdf+=`${String(offsets[i]||0).padStart(10,'0')} 00000 n \n`;pdf+=`trailer\n<< /Size ${objects.length} /Root 1 0 R >>\nstartxref\n${xref}\n%%EOF`;let blob=new Blob([pdf],{type:'application/pdf'}),url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=`Expedit_ToolManager_Rapport_${new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}.pdf`;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),1000);toast('Rapport PDF généré')}
